# Preserved source and scope notice

Selected KeePass Password Safe2.61.1 source files are copyright Dominik Reichl and contributors and licensed GPL-2.0-or-later. The exact selected17 source bodies and headers, full original GPL license and release-bound source ledger are mapped by source-license-provenance.json and source-proof/preservation-manifest.json. GROUP-EDIT-NOTICE.md is a separately proposed per-app notice. Original executable/archive carriers remain local; this publication plan preserves identities and test-only helpers, not those carrier bytes.

Historical failures, author/independent models and genuine browser media keep distinct source epochs and denominators. Original managed-library comparisons are historical, source-composed selected contracts with explicit clock/UUID fixture adapters; they are not whole-program or GUI parity. This plan performs byte/metadata validation only and leaves all production and installed-adapter execution to root.
